        "Set 1: 75 kg × 12 (RPE 8.5 — Hard)",
        "Set 2: 75 kg × 12 (RPE 9.5 — Max Effort, Set Quality: Momentum)",
        "Set 3: 75 kg × 10 (RPE 10 — Failure)"
      ]
    },
